  "notes": "{詰|つ}まる describes something becoming blocked, filled, or stuck. It emphasizes the resulting state rather than the action.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{詰|つ}める→詰める：02078_tsumeru⟧ (transitive, to pack/stuff)\n\nASPECT ({詰|つ}まっている):\nIndicates a resulting state: ⟦{鼻|はな}→鼻：02164_hana⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{詰|つ}まっている means 'nose is stuffed' (not 'is getting stuffed').\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{鼻|はな}→鼻：02164_hana⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{詰|つ}まる: nose is stuffed up\n- ⟦{言葉|ことば}→言葉：02880_kotoba⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{詰|つ}まる: to be at a loss for words\n- ⟦{息|いき}→息：02176_iki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{詰|つ}まる: to feel suffocated\n- ⟦{排水口|はいすいこう}→排水口：16250_haisuikou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{詰|つ}まる: drain is clogged\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n⟦つまり→つまり：03530_tsumari⟧ (in short, that is to say) comes from the sense of things coming together/condensing.",
